<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SHADOWCYPHER // APEX_2026 // TECHNICAL_SHOWCASE</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #00f2ff; --primary-glow: rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.4);
            --danger: #ff3b3b; --danger-glow: rgba(255, 59, 59, 0.4);
            --bg: #030406; --card: rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.98);
            --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --font-main: 'Outfit', sans-serif; --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body, html { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: var(--bg); color: #cbd5e1; font-family: var(--font-main); overflow-x: hidden; scroll-behavior: smooth; }

        /* --- NAVIGATION --- */
        nav { position: fixed; top: 0; width: 100%; padding: 40px 80px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; z-index: 1000; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--bg) 0%, transparent 100%); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
        .nav-logo { font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 12px; color: #fff; font-size: 24px; text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--primary-glow); }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 50px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; }
        .nav-links a { color: #64748b; text-decoration: none; transition: 0.3s; }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--primary); }

        /* --- HERO --- */
        .hero { height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .hero-img { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.4; filter: contrast(120%) grayscale(50%); z-index: -1; }
        .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 12vw, 180px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 40px; margin: 0; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 50px var(--primary-glow); text-align: center; }
        .hero .subtitle { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 15px; color: var(--primary); margin-top: 30px; opacity: 0.6; }

        /* --- SECTION --- */
        section { padding: 180px 10%; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); position: relative; }
        .label { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--primary); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 30px; display: block; }
        .title { font-size: clamp(35px, 6vw, 90px); font-weight: 800; color: #fff; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 60px; letter-spacing: -3px; }
        .title span { color: var(--primary); }

        /* --- TECHNICAL GRID --- */
        .tech-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 100px; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 120px; }
        .tech-img { border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border); box-shadow: 0 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); }
        .tech-img img { width: 100%; display: block; filter: brightness(0.9); transition: 0.5s; }
        .tech-img:hover img { transform: scale(1.02); filter: brightness(1.1); }
        .tech-body h3 { font-size: 40px; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 25px 0; font-weight: 900; }
        .tech-body p { font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.9; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 40px; }

        /* --- ARSENAL MATRIX (30+ REAL MODULES) --- */
        .matrix-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 100px; }
        .matrix-card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 40px; border-radius: 15px; transition: 0.4s; overflow: hidden; }
        .matrix-card:hover { border-color: var(--primary); background: rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.05); transform: translateY(-10px); }
        .matrix-card h5 { margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: var(--font-mono); }
        .matrix-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #475569; letter-spacing: 3px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }

        /* --- LOG SNIPPET (ABSOLUTE PROOF) --- */
        .log-box { background: #000; border: 1px solid #111; border-radius: 15px; padding: 40px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; color: #fff; margin-top: 100px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .log-box::before { content: 'LIVE_TELEMETRY'; position: absolute; top: 15px; right: 20px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--danger); letter-spacing: 5px; font-weight: 900; }
        .log-line { margin-bottom: 10px; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); animation: fadeIn 0.3s forwards; }
        @keyframes fadeIn { to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

        /* --- FOOTER --- */
        footer { padding: 150px 10%; background: #000; text-align: center; border-top: 2px solid var(--border); }
        .f-logo { font-size: 50px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 30px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .f-intl { font-size: 16px; color: var(--primary); opacity: 0.4; letter-spacing: 15px; }

        /* --- UTILS --- */
        .highlight { color: #fff; font-weight: 800; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary); }
        .intl-span { color: var(--primary); font-weight: 400; margin: 0 8px; opacity: 0.8; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
        <img class="hero-img" src="tactical_hud_overview_v2_1776394965594.png">
        <h1>SHADOWCYPHER</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">APEX_SOVEREIGN_INFRASTRUCTURE // 2026_CORE</div>
    </section>

    <!-- 120-DAY CHRONOLOGY -->
    <section>
        <span class="label">MODULE_01 // APEX_INTEGRATION // 出現</span>
        <h2 class="title">FROM CONCEPT TO <span>APEX</span> IN 120 DAYS</h2>
        <div class="tech-grid">
            <div class="tech-body">
                <h3>Absolute Sovereignty</h3>
                <p>
                    ShadowCypher emerged in early 2026 with a single mission: to provide absolute digital parity. By migrating away from high-level interpreters to a <span class="highlight">Native Go-Relay</span> swarm, we achieved the 'Signal Apex'.
                    <br><br>
                    Every primitive in the **Master Arsenal** is engineered to execute in the <span class="highlight">RAM-shadow</span>, ensuring no traces exist on the host OS. This is the truth of the Sovereign Apex <span class="intl-span">(디지털 주권)</span>.
                </p>
                <div style="margin-top: 40px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--primary); letter-spacing: 5px;">
                    [BOOT_JAN_2026] // [APEX_APR_2026]
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-img">
                <img src="tactical_hud_real_1776394858530.png">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- REAL CAPABILITY AUDIT -->
    <section style="background: rgba(0,242,255,0.01);">
        <span class="label">MODULE_02 // SYSTEM_CAPABILITY_AUDIT // 武器庫</span>
        <h2 class="title">VERIFIED <span>PRIMITIVES</span></h2>
        <p style="font-size: 22px; color: #64748b; max-width: 900px; margin-top: -30px;">A high-fidelity audit of the 30+ specialized modules identified in the ShadowCypher 2026 repository.</p>
        
        <div class="matrix-grid">
            <div class="matrix-card"><h5>gaming_osint.py</h5><p>INTEL_SIGNAL_HARVEST</p></div>
            <div class="matrix-card"><h5>web_exploit_v2.py</h5><p>APPLICATION_LEVEL_STRIKE</p></div>
            <div class="matrix-card"><h5>ad_attacks.py</h5><p>DOMAIN_PENETRATION</p></div>
            <div class="matrix-card"><h5>wireless.py</h5><p>AIR_GAP_BRIDGING</p></div>
            <div class="matrix-card"><h5>phishing.py</h5><p>SOCIAL_VECTOR_LURES</p></div>
            <div class="matrix-card"><h5>layer7.py</h5><p>SIGNAL_SATURATION</p></div>
            <div class="matrix-card"><h5>firewall.py</h5><p>SPECTRAL_PASSAGE</p></div>
            <div class="matrix-card"><h5>exfiltration.py</h5><p>DATA_CAPTURE_NEXUS</p></div>
            <div class="matrix-card"><h5>shadowcypher/compiler/shadowscript.py</h5><p>STACK_BASED_LOGIC</p></div>
            <div class="matrix-card"><h5>shadowcypher/core/nexus.py</h5><p>SWARM_P2P_HANDSHAKE</p></div>
            <div class="matrix-card"><h5>hub.py</h5><p>APEX_ORCHESTRATION</p></div>
            <div class="matrix-card"><h5>war_map_page.py</h5><p>GEOSPATIAL_OVERSIGHT</p></div>
        </div>

        <!-- LOG SNIPPET -->
        <div class="log-box">
            <div class="log-line">> [hub] SHADOWHUB_ULTIMA: MISSION_CONTROL_ENGAGED</div>
            <div class="log-line">> [hub] ARMING_CORE: Initializing native tactical primitives...</div>
            <div class="log-line">> [hub] RELAY_BRIDGE: Native signal link established.</div>
            <div class="log-line">> [bot] SENTINEL_V2_ACTIVE: Sovereign (Ergo) Handshake Sync [SUCCESS]</div>
            <div class="log-line" style="color: var(--primary);">> [COMMAND] Analyze 127.0.0.1:9999... [EXECUTING]</div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- NEURAL CORE (REAL ASSETS) -->
    <section>
        <span class="label">MODULE_03 // NEURAL_ORCHESTRATION // 神经核心</span>
        <h2 class="title">THE <span>AUTONOMOUS</span> ARCHITECTURE</h2>
        <div class="tech-grid">
            <div class="tech-img">
                <img src="assets/ai_engine/autoagent.png" style="filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(150%);">
            </div>
            <div class="tech-body">
                <h3>Autonomous Feedback Loops</h3>
                <p>
                    The **Autonomous Orchestration** engine eliminates the need for manual mission intervention. It recursively identifies tactical hurdles and deploys the optimal primitive from the arsenal with <span class="highlight">zero-latency</span> logic <span class="intl-span">(메타체인)</span>.
                </p>
                <p>Mission success is verified through a distributed consensus mesh across the signal swarm <span class="intl-span">(影子密码)</span>.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SOVEREIGN PARTNER -->
    <section id="partners" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, #010203, #040806);">
        <span class="label" style="color: #00ff88;">SOVEREIGN_PARTNERS // 技術パートナー</span>
        <div class="tech-grid" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center;">
            <div class="tech-body">
                <h3 style="font-size: 50px;">LOUST <span style="font-size: 20px; color: #00ff88; letter-spacing: 5px;">[PRO]</span></h3>
                <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 20px;">
                    Absolute operational parity requires absolute networking infrastructure. **Loust** provided the critical architectural foundation for our signal-transport layer—mastering the complexities of **UDP/TCP saturation**, **CORS Tunneling**, and infrastructure scaling.
                </p>
                <a href="https://www.loust.pro/" style="color: #00ff88; text-decoration: none; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 3px;">VISIT_CORE_PARTNER // WWW.LOUST.PRO</a>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-img" style="border-color: #00ff8844;">
                <img src="tactical_hud_real_1776394858530.png" style="filter: hue-rotate(90deg) brightness(1.1) contrast(1.2);">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>
        <div class="f-logo">SHADOWCYPHER</div>
        <div class="f-intl">ШИФР_ТЕНИ // 影子密码 // 섀도우 사이퍼 // シャドウ・サイファー</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 100px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.2; letter-spacing: 8px;">EST_2026 // NULL_TRACE_ARCHITECTS // NO_TRACE_LEFT</div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
